---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="About" description="Hazirminds is an AI solutions partner for small and mid-size businesses: we find where AI solves real problems, start small, and grow with you." current="about">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">About</span></nav>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;max-width:960px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">About Hazirminds</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(38px,5.2vw,68px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.035em;text-wrap:balance">Your AI solutions partner — starting small, growing with you.</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,21px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:60ch;text-wrap:pretty">We identify where AI can solve real business problems and implement the right solution, starting small and growing as your business does. We also manage the technology for you, so you don't have to figure out AI on your own.</p>
</div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:clamp(40px,5vw,56px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:24px 24px 0 0"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#B9852F">verified</span><span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Registered North Carolina LLC</span></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:24px 24px 0 0"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#B9852F">cloud</span><span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Hosted on AWS in the United States</span></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:24px 24px 0 0"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#B9852F">event_repeat</span><span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Month-to-month, no long lock-in</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-label="In short" style="background:#E8F2EE;padding:clamp(64px,9vw,120px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<figure style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;max-width:1000px">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width:56px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#B9852F"></span>
<blockquote style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,48px);line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#0F4C45;text-wrap:balance">You don't need to understand AI — that's our job. You just need to know what results you want.</blockquote>
<figcaption style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:56ch">We're not selling you technology. We're selling you more customers, less busywork, and time back.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="are-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Who we are</p>
<h2 id="are-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What we are, and what we're not</h2>
<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We start by understanding your business, find where AI genuinely helps, and implement the right-sized solution at the right time.</p>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">check_circle</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3">We are</h3></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45;margin-top:2px">check</span>An AI solutions partner</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45;margin-top:2px">check</span>A long-term business technology partner</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45;margin-top:2px">check</span>Problem-first: we lead with your business problem, not the technology</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="background:#F0EAE0;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#585E5A">do_not_disturb_on</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3">We're not</h3></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A;margin-top:2px">close</span>A vendor that delivers and disappears</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A;margin-top:2px">close</span>A seller of one-off AI products</li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A;margin-top:2px">close</span>A freelancer or a low-cost tool seller</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="diff-h" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Why Hazirminds</p>
<h2 id="diff-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Six things that set us apart</h2>
</div>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:40px 32px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">01</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">We lead with the business problem, not the technology.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">02</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">Start small, prove value, expand on real results — not a sales quota.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">03</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">One partner for the full stack: website, AI, integrations, automation, custom software, hosting and ongoing support.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">04</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">AI that is controlled, secure, and connected to your real business systems.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">05</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">You own your data and your relationships.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #B9852F"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0F4C45">06</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty">The relationship continues after launch.</p></li>
</ol>
<a href="/services" style="display:inline-block;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:48px">See all services →</a>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="pr-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">Our AI principles</p><h2 id="pr-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-wrap:balance">AI that stays controlled, secure and connected</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">The same five rules apply to every client, on every service.</p><a href="/security" style="color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:8px">Security &amp; data protection →</a></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">menu_book</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It answers only from your approved knowledge. It doesn't invent answers.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">rule</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">It acts only within the permissions and workflows you define.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">how_to_reg</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Sensitive or consequential actions need a person's approval.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">support_agent</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">When it's unsure, it says so and hands off to a person.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">lock</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Your data stays yours: owned and controlled by you.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>


<section aria-labelledby="facts-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="facts-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:40px">The details</h2>
<dl style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><dt style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">Company</dt><dd style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Hazir Minds, LLC, a registered North Carolina business</dd></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><dt style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">Who we serve</dt><dd style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Small and mid-size businesses in every industry. <a href="/industries">Industries</a></dd></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><dt style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">Technology providers</dt><dd style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">AWS for hosting, Twilio for voice and SMS, Anthropic for AI models</dd></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><dt style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">Contact</dt><dd style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7"><a href="mailto:contact@hazirminds.ai">contact@hazirminds.ai</a><br><a href="tel:+19199247608">919-924-7608</a></dd></div>
</dl>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cta-h" style="padding:0 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,360px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="cta-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,44px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Not sure where AI fits into your business yet?</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:48ch">That's exactly what the first conversation is for. No pressure, no pitch — just a look at what's possible for you.</p></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:fit-content"><a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:56px;padding:0 32px;border-radius:999px;background:#FAF7F2;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s">Book a Discovery Call<span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span></a><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:15px;color:#DCE7E4"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:18px;color:#DCE7E4">schedule</span>A 15-minute call</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#E3EDE9 !important;color:#0B3A35 !important}
</style>
